        "full_width": true,
        "color_scheme": "default"
      }
    },
    "rich_text_gFfzfQ": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_qL8zf6": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to Choose the Right Diamond",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_zEze6c": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Selecting a diamond involves balancing personal preference, budget, and quality factors.</p><h3>Key Considerations:</h3><p><strong>Set a Budget</strong><br/><br/>Define a comfortable spending range to guide your options.</p><p><strong>Prioritize the 4Cs</strong><br/><br/>Decide which factors matter most—cut quality, size, clarity, or color.</p><p><strong>Choose a Shape</strong><br/><br/>Popular diamond shapes include round, oval, cushion, emerald, and princess cuts.</p><p><strong>Compare Natural vs Lab-Grown</strong><br/><br/>Both options offer identical beauty, with differences in origin and pricing.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_qL8zf6",
        "text_zEze6c"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        ".subheading {color: #002058; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 6px;}"
      ],
      "name": "Rich text",
      "settings": {
        "height": "small",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "full_width": true,
        "color_scheme": "default"
      }
    },
    "rich_text_QXRhTU": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_dz7hqA": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tips for Buying Diamonds Online",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_b3PXbJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Buying diamonds online offers convenience and access to a wider selection, but it requires careful consideration.</p><p><strong>Review Product Details</strong><br/><br/>Look for complete specifications, certification, and high-quality images.</p><p><strong>Compare Pricing</strong><br/><br/>Evaluate similar diamonds across retailers to understand fair market value.</p><p><strong>Check Policies</strong><br/><br/>Ensure clear return policies, warranties, and after-sales support.</p><p><strong>Secure Payment Methods</strong><br/><br/>Choose retailers that offer trusted and secure payment options.</p><p>At Milano Jewelry, we provide transparent pricing, certified diamonds, and dedicated customer support throughout your purchase journey.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_dz7hqA",
        "text_b3PXbJ"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        ".subheading {color: #002058; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 6px;}"
